The '''Wartaki Sea''' was a [[Ocean|body]] of [[salt]] [[water]] located on the [[planet]] [[Kashyyyk]]. The [[Wawaatt Archipelago]] lay there. During the [[Battle of Kashyyyk]] in [[19 BBY]], the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]' contingent of [[NR-N99 Persuader-class droid enforcer|''Persuader''-class tanks]] and [[DSD1 dwarf spider droid|spider droids]] emerged from the Wartaki Sea to attack the coastal [[city]] of [[Kachirho]].<ref name="Battles" />

